'  RELATIONSHIPS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

' ── Adapters implement ports ─────────────────────────────
DirectiveRepository <|.. SqlDirectiveRepository : implements >
CgIrRepository <|.. ContentAddressedCgIrStore : implements >
EventStore <|.. AppendOnlyEventLog : implements >
ArtifactRepository <|.. ObjectArtifactStore : implements >
TargetGateway <|.. HttpTargetGateway : implements >

' ── Evaluator hierarchy ──────────────────────────────────
Evaluator <|.. PatternEvaluator : implements >
Evaluator <|.. StructuralEvaluator : implements >
Evaluator <|.. CompositeEvaluator : implements >
CompositeEvaluator o-right- "0..*" Evaluator : composes >
AdapterRegistry o-right- "0..*" Evaluator : registers >

' ── Adapters → external dependencies ────────────────────
SqlDirectiveRepository ..> SQLAlchemy : uses >
SqlDirectiveRepository ..> PostgreSQL : connects >
AppendOnlyEventLog ..> SQLAlchemy : uses >
AppendOnlyEventLog ..> PostgreSQL : connects >
ContentAddressedCgIrStore ..> Filesystem : reads/writes >
ContentAddressedCgIrStore ..> Hasher : uses >
ObjectArtifactStore ..> boto3 : uses >
ObjectArtifactStore ..> ObjectStore : connects >
HttpTargetGateway ..> httpx : uses >
PatternEvaluator ..> RE2 : uses >

' ── Bootstrap wiring ────────────────────────────────────
Lifespan ..> SqlDirectiveRepository : initializes >
Lifespan ..> ContentAddressedCgIrStore : initializes >
Lifespan ..> AppendOnlyEventLog : initializes >
Lifespan ..> ObjectArtifactStore : initializes >
Lifespan ..> HttpTargetGateway : initializes >
Lifespan ..> CapabilitySource : initializes >
Lifespan ..> AdapterRegistry : initializes >
Lifespan ..> LoggingSetup : calls >
Lifespan ..> ConfigLoader : calls >

' ── Auth capability source references domain ────────────
CapabilitySource ..> Hasher : uses >

